<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est 105,000, Wk ago 88,000, Yr ago 104,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Friday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
